# Keep the build context small and never bake a developer's machine state into the image.
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/.turbo
**/coverage
.git
.gitignore

# Environment files stay on the host; the compose file supplies what the containers need.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# Local-only documentation and agent tooling.
docs
tasks
CAPABILITY-MAP.md
AGENTS.md
.commandcode

*.log
.DS_Store
